  <metadata>
    <name>Šekijeva Trail (Grbaja – Jagnjičar)</name>
    <desc>Šekijeva Trail is a moderate one-way hiking trail in Prokletije National Park. It is 3.8 km long, with a total ascent of 1099 m and a duration of approximately 5 h without breaks. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
